  "details": "I was wondering if there was any plan to make this addition to the base VRC Camera. For many users, In game recording and streaming is a big thing. I myself do a lot of recording in the game and use my stream camera to record content for a couple servers and groups. The issue is, when I record and point my camera at the uses I'm recording, they stop what they are doing to pose for a picture. Causing me I have to restart and tell them that its a recording. Having a red or slight red fade in and out would solve this issue. People would see that its on stream mode, and that tells them that its not a picture. Any chance this could be implemented to the platform in the future?",
